        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/grand-theft-auto-6-man-with-flour-on-his-nose.png?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>In the wake of <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/gta-6-walkthrough\">Grand Theft Auto 6</a>'s release and the wave of glowing reviews it received, a war is raging in Metacritic's user reviews, with some of the medium's best games of all time caught in the crossfire.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/gta-6-metacritic-review-bomb\">Read more</a></p>",
