        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/grand-theft-auto-6-drinking.png?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>If you've been a fan of Grand Theft Auto for a while, you might have noticed a strange absence in <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/gta-6-walkthrough\">GTA 6</a>. While the game is packed full of different activities, the recurring pastime of darts is missing, having been present in <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/games/grand-theft-auto-v\">GTA 5</a>, <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/games/gta-online\">GTA Online</a>, and GTA 4.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/grand-theft-auto-6-no-darts-didnt-have-resources\">Read more</a></p>",
