        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/modern-warfare-4-beta-shot-crop-2.jpeg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>Call of Duty publisher Activision has filed for a new patent allowing it to train NPCs on real-world player voice chat. The patent describes an AI-driven system that listens in on player voice chat following key gameplay moments and later recreates it using in-game characters.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/activision-ai-voice-chat-npc-patent\">Read more</a></p>",
